    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Primal League is platformer metrodvania with multiple playable characters, a vast world and intricate crafting system</h2><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768560/extras/5a4ede57172dd30236aedf36366cd584.avif?t=1748968088\" width=569 height=159 /></span><br>The story begins when the Omnicore, the orb that fuel life to Cobal Crest Island, is stolen. This led to chaos and unstable of the whole island. a council was formed named The Primal League to deal with the crisis. After finding out the thief, the primal league discovers a much more sinister plot performed by a Criminal Syndicate. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768560/extras/367aeaf9ae65844cb2eb040bdf4a256a.avif?t=1748968088\" width=569 height=159 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768560/extras/289e8ceb1a9366bd3f36d2d67671e619.avif?t=1748968088\" width=569 height=159 /></span><br><br>admire the magnificent landscape <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768560/extras/d9ca733fa5d30942a76c254dbe6ea51d.poster.avif?t=1748968088\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768560/extras/d9ca733fa5d30942a76c254dbe6ea51d.webm?t=1748968088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768560/extras/d9ca733fa5d30942a76c254dbe6ea51d.mp4?t=1748968088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Overcome platforming challenges<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl